WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.456 --> 00:00:02.217
Hi there!

2
00:00:02.397 --> 00:00:03.538
[s@Hi there!

3
00:00:03.618 --> 00:00:04.378
Who are you?

4
00:00:04.499 --> 00:00:06.220
I'm a dragonfly.

5
00:00:10.163 --> 00:00:11.464
are very fast insects.

6
00:00:30.164 --> 00:00:31.205
Where do you live?

7
00:00:32.826 --> 00:00:35.048
Dragonflies live all over the world.

8
00:00:36.769 --> 00:00:38.730
We like to be near fresh water.

9
00:00:40.231 --> 00:00:42.293
We don't like cold places.

10
00:00:44.995 --> 00:00:47.236
Oh. Do you like warm weather?

11
00:00:48.357 --> 00:00:51.079
Yes. Dragonflies need warm weather.

12
00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:54.542
The sun warms up our wings.

13
00:00:56.383 --> 00:00:57.684
Then we can fly.

14
00:01:00.656 --> 00:01:02.117
You have big eyes!

15
00:01:03.498 --> 00:01:05.559
My eyes cover most of my head.

16
00:01:06.760 --> 00:01:08.941
They let me see all around.

17
00:01:10.182 --> 00:01:11.783
That's how I spot food.

18
00:01:14.244 --> 00:01:15.385
What do you eat?

19
00:01:17.526 --> 00:01:19.667
Dragonflies eat other insects.

20
00:01:21.168 --> 00:01:23.269
We love mosquitoes and gnats.

21
00:01:26.191 --> 00:01:27.512
Are you a good hunter?

22
00:01:29.496 --> 00:01:32.457
Yes! Dragonflies catch prey in the air.

23
00:01:34.097 --> 00:01:35.738
We chase other insects.

24
00:01:37.438 --> 00:01:39.439
Then we catch them with our feet.

25
00:01:42.380 --> 00:01:43.840
Do you have enemies?

26
00:01:45.761 --> 00:01:49.022
Fish, ducks, and big insects try to catch us.

27
00:01:50.882 --> 00:01:52.523
That's why we keep moving.

28
00:01:56.164 --> 00:01:57.224
Here comes a duck.

29
00:01:58.429 --> 00:02:00.093
It's time to fly away.

30
00:02:01.958 --> 00:02:03.502
Good-bye, Dragonfly!
